proton-autogen (2.4.4) noble; urgency=medium

  * UT3 support
    - Unreal Tournament III: added dedicated "UT3 FIXED" profile
    - Improved UE3 (D3D9) stability under Proton + DXVK

  * Improved executable detection and profile system
    - More robust classification for launchers, DX11/DX12 games, and legacy DX8/DX9 games
    - Improved handling of ambiguous executable names and Steam wrappers

  * Environment profile isolation
    - Fixed issue where environment variables could leak between profiles
    - Strict separation between launcher, modern games, UE3/UT3, and legacy profiles

  * Legacy game support improvements
    - Improved WineD3D profile for DX8/DX9 games (e.g. Unreal Tournament 99)
    - Correct handling of PROTON_USE_WINED3D and WINEDLLOVERRIDES for legacy titles

  * Stability fixes
    - Fixed conflicts between launcher and oldgame profiles
    - Improved stability for Battle.net, EA App, and Ubisoft Connect
    - Fixed incorrect environment overrides affecting specific D3D9 games

  * Compatibility improvements
    - Better support for GE-Proton environments
    - Improved compatibility with DXVK and VKD3D-Proton setups
    - Reduced unintended interference with Vulkan/DXVK configuration

  * Technical improvements
    - Cleaner ESYNC/FSYNC handling per profile
    - Reduced unnecessary DXVK/Vulkan environment pollution

  * Legacy support
    - Added support for legacy applications (Photoshop / ImageReady class software)

